{
  "contract": "assurance_kernel/task_intent/v1",
  "task_id": "slice-size-limit",
  "owner": "user",
  "goal": "TaskIntent validation refuses a candidate with more than 15 counted scope_hint paths unless it states `scope_size_reason`, and the Planner contract caps Slice size and gives deletion-heavy retirement its own Slice (Spec branch-boundary-r2-followups D6).",
  "acceptance": [
    {
      "id": "AC1",
      "assertion": "`imm-kernel intent validate` reports `scope_estimate_too_wide` with `enrollment_ready: false` for a candidate with 16 counted `scope_hint` paths and no `scope_size_reason`, and `enrollment_ready: true` for 15 counted paths and for 16 with a `scope_size_reason`; `.changeset/**`, the intent's own `docs/plans/<task_id>.intent.json`, `docs/specs/*.spec.md` and outputs declared in `docs/agents/derived-files.json` are not counted.",
      "verification": "{\n  \"contract\": \"assurance_kernel/verification_descriptor/v2\",\n  \"command\": {\n    \"executable\": \"bun\",\n    \"argv\": [\n      \"test\",\n      \"tests/kernel-intent-validation.test.ts\"\n    ],\n    \"cwd\": \".\",\n    \"timeout_ms\": 300000,\n    \"max_output_bytes\": 131072\n  },\n  \"environment\": {\n    \"prepare\": null,\n    \"writable_paths\": []\n  }\n}\n"
    },
    {
      "id": "AC2",
      "assertion": "`scope_size_reason` that is empty, longer than 500 characters or not a string makes the intent invalid; an intent without the field parses as before; `imm-kernel intent author` refuses an over-cap candidate without a reason and creates no file.",
